{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a responsive alternating feature showcase section with pure white background. Build 4 feature blocks, each with a blue-sky product image/video card (rounded corners) paired with a navy headline and paragraph text. Desktop layout alternates left/right (image left → text right, then text left → image right). Mobile layout stacks vertically in order: headline → text → media, full width cards with no cropping.
    
    Blocks:
    
    SWAPS OUT IN SECONDS
    Text:
    “Just lift out the empty ring and drop in a new one — that’s it. No tools, no mess, no fuss.
    Done in under 10 seconds, and you’re back to living your best (trash-free) life.”
    Media: short demo video of ring removal + insert.
    
    BAGS THAT LOAD THEMSELVES
    Text:
    “Once a bag is sealed, the next one drops into place automatically — no touching, no replacing, no ‘ugh, I forgot the bag again’ moments.
    Smart Refill Rings keep your bin ready, so you’re always one step ahead.”
    Media: short video showing bag auto-reload inside clear bin.
    
    SAVE TIME & MONEY
    Text:
    “One refill ring gives you 25 self-sealing bags — less than 60¢ per use with no mess, no tying, and no store trips.
    Just load one ring and let it auto-seal, drop, and reload. Refill delivery keeps you from ever running out.”
    Media: product image of stacked refill rings.
    
    SLEEK, MODERN DESIGN
    Text:
    “The Smart Refill Ring fits seamlessly inside the Royal Bin — no clutter, no extra parts, no visible mess.
    Bags stay hidden and your space stays fresh.”
    Media: product image of bin with refill ring loaded.
    
    Styling:
    
    Headlines: bold navy #002B5B, all caps, tight tracking.
    
    Body text: modern sans-serif, medium gray #444, comfortable line spacing (not tight).
    
    Media cards: light blue background, rounded only, no borders or shadows.
    
    Desktop: two-column alternating layout with generous white space.
    
    Mobile: single-column vertical stack with large media cards and natural spacing between text blocks.
    
    No section borders, frames, or CSS shadows.
{% enddoc %}

{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-feature-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 80px 20px;
  }

  .ai-feature-showcase-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-feature-block-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 100px;
  }

  .ai-feature-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .ai-feature-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-reverse-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    direction: rtl;
  }

  .ai-feature-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-reverse-{{ ai_gen_id }} > * {
    direction: ltr;
  }

  .ai-feature-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-feature-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #002B5B;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-feature-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #444444;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-feature-media-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #E3F2FD;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-feature-media-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} img,
  .ai-feature-media-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} video {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-feature-media-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #E3F2FD;
    border-radius: 16px;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-feature-media-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 400px;
    max-height: 400px;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-feature-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 20px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    padding: 12px 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #666;
    text-align: center;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-feature-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    .ai-feature-block-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 80px;
    }

    .ai-feature-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-reverse-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      direction: ltr;
    }

    .ai-feature-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0;
      order: 1;
    }

    .ai-feature-media-card-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-feature-media-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      order: 2;
    }

    .ai-feature-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .ai-feature-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-feature-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 40px 16px;
    }

    .ai-feature-block-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
    }

    .ai-feature-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .ai-feature-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-feature-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-feature-showcase-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.feature_1_enabled %}
      <div class="ai-feature-block-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-feature-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.feature_1_headline != blank %}
            <h2 class="ai-feature-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.feature_1_headline }}</h2>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.feature_1_text != blank %}
            <div class="ai-feature-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.feature_1_text }}</div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div>
          {% if block.settings.feature_1_video != blank %}
            <div class="ai-feature-media-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.feature_1_video | video_tag: autoplay: true, loop: true, muted: true, controls: false }}
            </div>
          {% elsif block.settings.feature_1_image != blank %}
            <div class="ai-feature-media-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <img
                src="{{ block.settings.feature_1_image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
                alt="{{ block.settings.feature_1_image.alt | escape }}"
                loading="lazy"
                width="{{ block.settings.feature_1_image.width }}"
                height="{{ block.settings.feature_1_image.height }}"
              >
            </div>
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-feature-media-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              <div class="ai-feature-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                Add an image or video
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.feature_2_enabled %}
      <div class="ai-feature-block-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-reverse-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
